{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新加坡即日起無牌養貓屬違法，最高罰款約3萬港元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當局前年實行貓隻管理框架，推出寵物貓登記制度和貓隻的多項計劃，兩年過渡期周一結束，有超過11萬隻貓完成登記，周二起嚴格執行無牌養貓屬違法，最高可罰款5,000新加坡元，折合約3萬港元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.SING.CAT-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Aq9AqDCv3f1788267351.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SING.CAT-2300_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在新規定下，組屋每戶最多只准養兩隻貓，私人住宅最多可養三隻貓或狗，如果數目超過限制，只要在過渡期內申請了執照便可保留，當局稱所有寵物貓，必須由主人申請執照和植入晶片，以便追蹤位置，促使主人更負責任，一旦貓走失也更易歸還主人。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SING.CAT-2300_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026hGmQgJM3YL1788269098.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SING.CAT-2300_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"J.SING.CAT 2300.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026AYax4pNOZh1788268861.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"J.SING.CAT 2300.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T13:40:12.717161+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":230,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}